#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Raises revenue. Adds one point to the commercial tax rate used by demand, "
"which reduces commercial demand."
msgstr ""
"Genera ingresos. Añade un punto al tipo impositivo comercial utilizado para "
"calcular la demanda, lo que reduce la demanda comercial."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Raises revenue. Adds one point to the residential tax rate used by demand, "
"which reduces residential demand."
msgstr ""
"Genera ingresos. Añade un punto al tipo impositivo residencial utilizado "
"para calcular la demanda, lo que reduce la demanda residencial."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Raises revenue. Adds 16 to the local crime calculation before smoothing."
msgstr ""
"Genera ingresos. Añade 16 al cálculo de delincuencia local antes del "
"suavizado."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Raises revenue. No additional traffic or demand effect is implemented."
msgstr ""
"Genera ingresos. No se ha implementado ningún efecto adicional sobre el "
"tráfico o la demanda."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Adds fire coverage around developed residential, commercial and"
" industrial tiles."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Añade cobertura de bomberos alrededor de las casillas "
"residenciales, comerciales e industriales desarrolladas."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Costs money. Adds five years to the newborn life-expectancy input."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Añade cinco años al valor de esperanza de vida de los recién"
" nacidos."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Adds health capacity based on the residential budget base."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Añade capacidad sanitaria en función de la base "
"presupuestaria residencial."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Costs money. No additional health or education effect is implemented."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. No se ha implementado ningún efecto adicional sobre la salud"
" o la educación."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Prevents the education loss applied when population moves "
"between age groups."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Evita la pérdida de educación aplicada cuando la población "
"cambia de grupo de edad."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Adds police coverage around developed residential, commercial "
"and industrial tiles, reducing crime."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Añade cobertura policial alrededor de las casillas "
"residenciales, comerciales e industriales desarrolladas, reduciendo la "
"delincuencia."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Reduces the effective commercial tax rate by one point, "
"increasing commercial demand."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Reduce en un punto el tipo impositivo comercial efectivo, "
"aumentando la demanda comercial."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Reduces the effective industrial tax rate by one point, "
"increasing industrial demand."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Reduce en un punto el tipo impositivo industrial efectivo, "
"aumentando la demanda industrial."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Reduces the effective residential tax rate by one point, "
"increasing residential demand."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Reduce en un punto el tipo impositivo residencial efectivo, "
"aumentando la demanda residencial."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Adds one twelfth to available power-grid capacity, allowing "
"more consumers to be supplied."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Aumenta en una doceava parte la capacidad disponible de la "
"red eléctrica, permitiendo abastecer a más consumidores."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Costs money. Prevents new nuclear power plants from being selected."
msgstr "Tiene un coste. Impide seleccionar nuevas centrales nucleares."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Costs money. Reduces pollution and demand from polluting industries. Adds "
"one point to the effective industrial tax rate, reducing industrial demand."
msgstr ""
"Tiene un coste. Reduce la contaminación y la demanda de las industrias "
"contaminantes. Añade un punto al tipo impositivo industrial efectivo, "
"reduciendo la demanda industrial."

