#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"OpenSC2K is an open-source reimplementation of SimCity 2000 for Windows 95."
msgstr ""
"OpenSC2K es una reimplementación de código abierto de SimCity 2000 para "
"Windows 95."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"Save a copy of the open city each minute to the OpenSC2K Autosaves folder\n"
"in the temporary folder, and keep the copies of the last 10 minutes.\n"
"File > Open Autosave Folder shows them. The city file does not change."
msgstr ""
"Guarda cada minuto una copia de la ciudad abierta en la carpeta OpenSC2K Autosaves\n"
"del directorio temporal y conserva las copias de los últimos 10 minutos.\n"
"Archivo > Abrir carpeta de autoguardado las muestra. El archivo de la ciudad no cambia."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"When OpenSC2K starts, not more than one time each day, it sends a request to GitHub\n"
"to find a newer release of the OpenSC2K project. The request contains only the data\n"
"that is necessary to make the request. OpenSC2K shares no other information."
msgstr ""
"Al iniciarse, OpenSC2K consulta GitHub como máximo una vez al día\n"
"para buscar una versión más reciente. La consulta contiene solo los datos\n"
"necesarios para realizarla. OpenSC2K no comparte más información."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"How often the city plays vehicle sounds such as trains, aircraft, ships, and boats.\n"
"Reduced plays no more than one vehicle sound every 30 seconds. Off plays none.\n"
"Disaster sounds always play."
msgstr ""
"Frecuencia de los sonidos de trenes, aviones, barcos y otros vehículos.\n"
"«Reducida» reproduce como máximo un sonido cada 30 segundos. «Desactivada» no reproduce ninguno.\n"
"Los sonidos de las catástrofes siempre se reproducen."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"The General MIDI SoundFont that plays the MIDI music.\n"
"A custom SoundFont that fails to load falls back to the system sound set."
msgstr ""
"SoundFont General MIDI que reproduce la música MIDI.\n"
"Si no se puede cargar un SoundFont personalizado, se usan los sonidos del sistema."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"Use the sc2kfix corrections of the original Windows sprites:\n"
"aligned buildings and the animated colours of the DOS and Macintosh versions.\n"
"They do not apply while a SCURK tile set is loaded or HD graphics show."
msgstr ""
"Usa las correcciones de sc2kfix para los gráficos originales de Windows:\n"
"edificios alineados y colores animados de las versiones DOS y Macintosh.\n"
"No se aplican con un conjunto gráfico SCURK cargado o gráficos HD visibles."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"Show the underground view on a dark background,\n"
"with brighter lines for pipes, water mains, and subways."
msgstr ""
"Muestra la vista subterránea sobre un fondo oscuro,\n"
"con líneas más claras para tuberías, conducciones principales y metro."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid "%s is already bound to %s. Reassign it?"
msgstr "%s ya está asignado a %s. ¿Reasignarlo?"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid "Save changes to %s before you continue?"
msgstr "¿Guardar los cambios de %s antes de continuar?"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"The number of tiles on each side of the map.\n"
"SimCity 2000 compatibility uses only 128 × 128."
msgstr ""
"Número de casillas de cada lado del mapa.\n"
"La compatibilidad con SimCity 2000 solo admite 128 × 128."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"On: make an SC2 city that the original SimCity 2000 can open.\n"
"The map is 128 × 128.\n"
"\n"
"Off: make an SC2X city. The map can use other sizes, and data maps\n"
"such as land value and pollution have one value for each tile.\n"
"The original SimCity 2000 cannot open SC2X cities."
msgstr ""
"Activado: crea una ciudad SC2 compatible con el SimCity 2000 original.\n"
"El mapa es de 128 × 128.\n"
"\n"
"Desactivado: crea una ciudad SC2X. Permite otros tamaños de mapa y los mapas\n"
"de datos, como valor del terreno y contaminación, tienen un valor por casilla.\n"
"El SimCity 2000 original no puede abrir ciudades SC2X."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"The language of menus, windows and bundled original-game text. Custom text "
"stays as entered."
msgstr ""
"Idioma de los menús, ventanas y textos del juego original incluidos. Los "
"textos personalizados se mantienen tal como se escribieron."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"The graphics size at 10% zoom. Larger graphics show more detail.\n"
"Higher zoom levels cannot use a smaller size."
msgstr ""
"Tamaño de los gráficos al 10% de zoom. Los gráficos mayores muestran más detalle.\n"
"Los niveles de zoom superiores no pueden usar un tamaño menor."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"The graphics size at 200% zoom. Larger graphics show more detail.\n"
"This size cannot be smaller than the size at 100% zoom."
msgstr ""
"Tamaño de los gráficos al 200% de zoom. Los gráficos mayores muestran más detalle.\n"
"Este tamaño no puede ser menor que al 100% de zoom."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; includes multiline tooltips and
#. confirmation messages.
msgid ""
"The graphics size at 25% zoom. Larger graphics show more detail.\n"
"This size cannot be smaller than the size at 10% zoom."
